THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This licence covers the source in this repository only. It does not change the
terms of the components the application uses, each of which remains under its own
licence:

  - Depth Anything V2 Small (the depth model shipped with the app): Apache
    License 2.0. The larger Base and Large models are CC-BY-NC-4.0 and are not
    included.
  - FFmpeg, through PyAV: downloaded at run time from PyPI, under its own
    (LGPL/GPL) terms.
  - Qt, through PySide6: LGPL.
  - IBM Plex Sans / Mono (Copyright 2017 IBM Corp.) and Archivo (Copyright 2019 The Archivo Project
    Authors): SIL Open Font License 1.1, text in ultimate_video_3d/assets/fonts/OFL.txt.
  - ONNX Runtime, NumPy, OpenCV, Numba: their respective permissive licences.

The application connects to the network only (1) to download the video component
(FFmpeg via PyAV) from pypi.org the first time it is needed, and (2) to ask
api.github.com, once at launch, whether a newer version has been published (this can
be switched off in Settings; it only shows a notice and a link, and downloads and
installs nothing). It has no telemetry.


NOTE ON FORKING

Publishing the source on a public host lets others view it and, by that host's
terms, fork it. A fork made that way is for reading and personal use only, under
the terms above.
